{"surah":104,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"arabic":"وَيۡلࣱ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةࣲ لُّمَزَةٍ","translit":"Waylun likulli humazatin lumazatin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Woe to every scorner and mocker"}},{"n":2,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِي جَمَعَ مَالࣰ ا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","translit":"Allathee jamaAAa malan waAAaddadahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it"}},{"n":3,"arabic":"يَحۡسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخۡلَدَهُۥ","translit":"Yahsabu anna malahu akhladahu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal"}},{"n":4,"arabic":"كَلَّاۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِي ٱلۡحُطَمَةِ","translit":"Kalla layunbathanna fee alhutamati","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher"}},{"n":5,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡحُطَمَةُ","translit":"Wama adraka ma alhutamatu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher"}},{"n":6,"arabic":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلۡمُوقَدَةُ","translit":"Naru Allahi almooqadatu","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled"}},{"n":7,"arabic":"ٱلَّتِي تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلۡأَفۡـِٔدَةِ","translit":"Allatee tattaliAAu AAala alafidati","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Which mounts directed at the hearts"}},{"n":8,"arabic":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيۡهِم مُّؤۡصَدَةࣱ‏","translit":"lnnaha AAalayhim musadatun","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them"}},{"n":9,"arabic":"فِي عَمَدࣲ مُّمَدَّدَةِۭ","translit":"Fee AAamadin mumaddadatin","t":{"eng-ummmuhammad":"In extended columns"}}]}